<title>USA: Oakley CFO Newcomb becomes COO.</title>
<headline>Oakley CFO Newcomb becomes COO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakley Inc said Friday it had named Robert Bruning as chief financial officer, succeeding Link Newcomb, who becomes chief operating officer, a newly created position.</p>
<p>Newcomb also joins the board of directors, increasing the number of board seats to six.</p>
<p>Bruning was most recently chief financial officer at Cobra Golf before it was bought by American Brands last year.</p>
